# {{ .ProjectName }}

A modern Go REST API service built with [Injel Framework](https://github.com/Injel-Framework/Injel).

## Requirements

- Go 1.24+

## Getting Started

1. Copy the example environment file:
   ```bash
   cp .env.example .env
   ```

2. Run the application:
   ```bash
   go run .
   ```

3. Test the endpoints:
   ```bash
   # Health check
   curl http://localhost:8080/health

   # Hello API
   curl http://localhost:8080/api/v1/hello
   ```

